r the lessee’s exclusive use at the sites it chooses. The owner may not substitute other"],["equipment during the term."],["4. The lessee insures, maintains and operates the equipment and pays its fuel. The owner provides no operator."],["5. Title stays with the owner. The equipment is not specialized; the owner rents it to others after the term."],["Demonstration document. Not a real agreement."]],"images":[{"dataUrl":"data:image/webp;base64,","width":704,"height":911}],"kind":"crane","primary":true}